{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "把这一刻，留给彼此" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep this moment, together" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "この瞬間を、ふたりのものに" } } } },
    "相伴记录帮助你们当面表达、彼此确认，再把共同的记录留在自己选择的地方。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A gentle way to express yourselves, confirm together, and keep a shared record where you choose." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりで気持ちを伝え、確認し合い、選んだ場所に記録を残すためのアプリです。" } } } },
    "开始设置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Get started" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定を始める" } } } },
    "欢迎" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Welcome" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ようこそ" } } } },
    "每个人都亲自参与" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Everyone takes part" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりがそれぞれ参加" } } } },
    "两个人会分别确认资料，并亲自开始自己的录制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You each confirm your details and start your own recording." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "それぞれがプロフィールを確認し、自分で録画を始めます。" } } } },
    "内容只留在你们手里" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "It stays with you" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの手元だけに" } } } },
    "不需要账号，也不会上传到开发者服务器。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No account is needed, and nothing is uploaded to the developer's servers." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "アカウントは不要で、開発者のサーバーにもアップロードしません。" } } } },
    "保存位置由你们决定" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You choose where to save" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存場所はふたりで決める" } } } },
    "可以在一台机器上保存，也可以在两台附近设备上各自保存。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save on one device, or save separately on two nearby devices." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1台で保存することも、近くの2台でそれぞれ保存することもできます。" } } } },
    "仅限所有参与者明确知情、自愿且已达到法定成年年龄时使用。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use only when everyone involved is informed, willing, and legally an adult." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "関係する全員が内容を理解し、自発的に同意し、法的に成人である場合にのみ使用してください。" } } } },
    "我确认自己已成年，并将仅用于合法、自愿的用途" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "I am an adult and will use this only lawfully and voluntarily" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "私は成人で、合法かつ自発的な目的にのみ使用します" } } } },
    "继续设置私密空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Set up private space" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースを設定" } } } },
    "确认使用方式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Confirm how you'll use it" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使い方を確認" } } } },
    "建立你的私密空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Create your private space" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースを作成" } } } },
    "密码只由你掌握。你们的记录、姓名和头像都不会传给开发者。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Only you know the password. Your records, names, and photos are not sent to the developer." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードを知るのはあなただけ。記録や名前、画像が開発者に送られることはありません。" } } } },
    "密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワード" } } } },
    "至少 12 个字符（区分大小写与空格）" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "At least 12 characters (case and spaces matter)" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "12文字以上（大文字・小文字と空白を区別）" } } } },
    "再次输入密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enter the password again" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードをもう一度入力" } } } },
    "辅助记忆提示词（可选，最多 60 字）" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Password hint (optional, up to 60 characters)" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードのヒント（任意、60文字まで）" } } } },
    "提示词不是密码，只是帮助你想起密码的线索；忘记密码后无法恢复记录。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A hint is not the password. It is only a clue; records cannot be recovered if the password is forgotten." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ヒントはパスワードではなく、思い出すための手がかりです。パスワードを忘れると記録は復元できません。" } } } },
    "提示词超过 60 字。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The hint is longer than 60 characters." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ヒントは60文字以内にしてください。" } } } },
    "我了解这是只留在我们手里的私密记录。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "I understand this is a private record kept only by us." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "これはふたりだけのプライベートな記録だと理解しました。" } } } },
    "创建私密空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Create private space" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースを作成" } } } },
    "私密空间密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Private space password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースのパスワード" } } } },
    "打开私密空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open private space" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースを開く" } } } },
    "提示：%@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hint: %@" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ヒント：%@" } } } },
    "未设置提示词。忘记密码将无法恢复已加密内容。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No hint is set. Encrypted content cannot be recovered if the password is forgotten." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ヒントは設定されていません。パスワードを忘れると暗号化された内容は復元できません。" } } } },
    "打开" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開く" } } } },
    "清除本机私密空间…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clear private space on this device…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのプライベートスペースを消去…" } } } },
    "重置只清除本机配置，不能删除已导出的 iCloud 文件。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Reset only clears this device's settings; exported iCloud files are not deleted." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "リセットで消えるのはこのデバイスの設定だけです。書き出したiCloudファイルは削除されません。" } } } },
    "清除本机配置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clear device settings" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デバイスの設定を消去" } } } },
    "取消" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cancel" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "キャンセル" } } } },
    "姓名与头像" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Name and photo" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "名前と画像" } } } },
    "这里的名字和头像只用于彼此确认，并保存在本机。可以填写对方熟悉的称呼；应用不会核验身份。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your name and photo are only used for confirming each other and stay on this device. Use a name your partner knows; the app does not verify identities." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "名前と画像はお互いの確認にだけ使い、このデバイスに保存します。相手が分かる呼び名を入力してください。本人確認は行いません。" } } } },
    "个人资料" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Profile" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プロフィール" } } } },
    "选择头像" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose photo" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "画像を選択" } } } },
    "更换头像" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Change photo" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "画像を変更" } } } },
    "姓名" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Name" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "名前" } } } },
    "保存并继续" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save and continue" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存して続ける" } } } },
    "选一个平时更顺手的方式。每次开始记录时仍然可以重新选择。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose what feels easiest. You can choose again each time you make a record." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "普段使いやすい方法を選びましょう。記録を始めるたびに変更できます。" } } } },
    "保存方式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save method" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存方法" } } } },
    "同机保存" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "One device" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1台で保存" } } } },
    "双机保存（推荐）" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Two devices (recommended)" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台で保存（おすすめ）" } } } },
    "在一台手机上轮流完成两段记录。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Take turns making the two parts on one phone." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1台のスマートフォンで交互に2つの記録を作ります。" } } } },
    "两台手机直接连接，各自录制、各自保存。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Connect two phones directly; each person records and saves their own copy." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台のスマートフォンを直接つなぎ、それぞれが録画・保存します。" } } } },
    "更安心" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Extra peace of mind" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "より安心" } } } },
    "进入首页" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Go to home" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ホームへ" } } } },
    "我们的记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Our records" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの記録" } } } },
    "你好，%@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hi, %@" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "こんにちは、%@" } } } },
    "你" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "you" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "あなた" } } } },
    "一起留下只属于你们的记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep a record that belongs only to you two" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりだけの記録を残しましょう" } } } },
    "开始一份新记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Start a new record" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "新しい記録を始める" } } } },
    "默认使用双机模式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Two-device mode by default" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デフォルトは2台モード" } } } },
    "默认使用同机模式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "One-device mode by default" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デフォルトは1台モード" } } } },
    "一起记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Record together" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一緒に記録" } } } },
    "同一台手机" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "One phone" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1台のスマートフォン" } } } },
    "轮流完成两段记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Take turns making two parts" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "交互に2つの記録を作る" } } } },
    "两台手机" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Two phones" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台のスマートフォン" } } } },
    "各自录制、各自保存" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Record and save separately" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "それぞれが録画・保存" } } } },
    "已保存的内容" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Saved content" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存した内容" } } } },
    "打开一份私密记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open a private record" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートな記録を開く" } } } },
    "删除待导出草稿" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete export drafts" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "書き出し待ちの下書きを削除" } } } },
    "我的设置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "My settings" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定" } } } },
    "资料与隐私" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Profile and privacy" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プロフィールとプライバシー" } } } },
    "锁定私密空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Lock private space" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースをロック" } } } },
    "待导出草稿" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Export drafts" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "書き出し待ちの下書き" } } } },
    "重新导出" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Export again" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "もう一度書き出す" } } } },
    "删除" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "削除" } } } },
    "全部删除" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete all" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "すべて削除" } } } },
    "本机资料" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This device's profile" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのプロフィール" } } } },
    "保存资料" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save profile" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プロフィールを保存" } } } },
    "默认保存方式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Default save method" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "デフォルトの保存方法" } } } },
    "模式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mode" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "モード" } } } },
    "隐私说明" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Privacy" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライバシー" } } } },
    "只属于你们" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Just for you two" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりだけのもの" } } } },
    "不需要登录，也不会上传给开发者。双机模式只在附近设备之间直接传输；导出位置由你们自己选择。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No sign-in and no upload to the developer. Two-device mode transfers directly nearby; you choose where to export." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ログイン不要で、開発者にアップロードしません。2台モードは近くのデバイス間で直接転送し、書き出し先はふたりで選べます。" } } } },
    "请在彼此都已成年、清楚并愿意的情况下使用。姓名和头像由你们自己填写，应用不会进行身份核验。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use when you are both adults, informed, and willing. You enter names and photos yourself; the app does not verify identity." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりが成人で、内容を理解し、自発的に望んでいる場合に使用してください。名前と画像は自分で入力し、本人確認は行いません。" } } } },
    "水印中的设备时间用于整理和回看。临时文件会按流程删除，但设备系统不提供物理擦除证明。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The device time in the watermark helps organize and revisit records. Temporary files are removed as part of the flow, but the system cannot prove physical erasure." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "透かしのデバイス時刻は整理や振り返りのためのものです。一時ファイルは手順に沿って削除しますが、物理的な消去を証明するものではありません。" } } } },
    "内容已遮蔽" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Content hidden" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "内容を非表示" } } } },
    "回到前台后可继续操作" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You can continue when the app is active" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "アプリを前面に戻すと続けられます" } } } },
    "知道了" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "OK" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "OK" } } } },
    "同机记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "One-device record" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1台で記録" } } } },
    "双机记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Two-device record" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台で記録" } } } },
    "你们的名字" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your names" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの名前" } } } },
    "接下来会发生什么" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "What happens next" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "これから行うこと" } } } },
    "前置摄像头和麦克风会一起开启" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The front camera and microphone will turn on" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "前面カメラとマイクを同時に使います" } } } },
    "每个人都有 3 秒准备时间，最长 30 秒" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Each person gets 3 seconds to prepare, up to 30 seconds" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "準備時間は3秒、最長30秒です" } } } },
    "画面会留下时间、角色和短会话号" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The frame includes the time, role, and short session ID" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "画面に時刻、役割、短いセッション番号が残ります" } } } },
    "结束后按 A → B 合成为一段视频" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The two parts are joined A → B" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "終了後にA → Bの順で1本にまとめます" } } } },
    "先从参与者 A 开始" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Participant A goes first" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者Aから始める" } } } },
    "让两台手机靠近一点" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bring the two phones closer" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台のスマートフォンを近づけてください" } } } },
    "你们的手机会直接建立加密连接。二维码里没有视频、密码或头像。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your phones create an encrypted connection directly. The QR code contains no video, password, or photo." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スマートフォン同士が直接暗号化接続します。QRコードに動画、パスワード、画像は含まれません。" } } } },
    "展示我的二维码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Show my QR code" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "自分のQRコードを表示" } } } },
    "扫描对方二维码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Scan partner's QR code" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手のQRコードをスキャン" } } } },
    "或粘贴二维码文本" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Or paste QR text" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "またはQRテキストを貼り付け" } } } },
    "使用粘贴文本连接" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Connect with pasted text" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "貼り付けたテキストで接続" } } } },
    "请让对方用本应用扫描此二维码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ask your partner to scan this QR code in the app" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手にこのアプリでQRコードをスキャンしてもらってください" } } } },
    "确认连接对象" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Confirm who you're connecting to" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続相手を確認" } } } },
    "对方显示姓名" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Partner's displayed name" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手に表示される名前" } } } },
    "请当面核对双方屏幕上的六码是否一致" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Check in person that the six-digit codes match" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "画面の6桁コードが一致するか、対面で確認してください" } } } },
    "我确认资料正确且六码一致" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The details are correct and the six-digit codes match" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プロフィールが正しく、6桁コードが一致していることを確認しました" } } } },
    "取消配对" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cancel pairing" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ペアリングをキャンセル" } } } },
    "正在接收对方的加密视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Receiving your partner's encrypted video…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手の暗号化動画を受信中…" } } } },
    "视频通过附近设备直接传输，不经过开发者服务器。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The video transfers directly between nearby devices, not through the developer's servers." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画は近くのデバイス間で直接転送され、開発者のサーバーは経由しません。" } } } },
    "连接中断 · 片段已暂存" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Connection interrupted · clip staged" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続が中断 · クリップを一時保存" } } } },
    "重新传输暂存片段" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Transfer staged clip again" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時保存したクリップを再転送" } } } },
    "双方同步录制" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Record together" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりで同時に録画" } } } },
    "我已阅读并理解以上说明" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "I have read and understand the information above" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "上の説明を読み、理解しました" } } } },
    "本人已准备好" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "I'm ready" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "準備できました" } } } },
    "REC" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "REC" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "REC" } } } },
    "加密记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypted record" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化された記録" } } } },
    "打开加密文件" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open encrypted file" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化ファイルを開く" } } } },
    "选择此前导出的 `.xagree` 加密文件。仅在输入正确密码后，视频才会临时在本机解密播放。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose an exported `.xagree` file. The video is decrypted temporarily on this device only after the correct password is entered." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "書き出した`.xagree`暗号化ファイルを選択してください。正しいパスワードを入力した後だけ、このデバイスで一時的に復号して再生します。" } } } },
    "加密文件" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypted file" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化ファイル" } } } },
    "选择文件" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose file" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ファイルを選択" } } } },
    "文件密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "File password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ファイルのパスワード" } } } },
    "正在解密…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Decrypting…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "復号中…" } } } },
    "解锁并播放" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unlock and play" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ロックを解除して再生" } } } },
    "记录信息" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Record details" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "記録の情報" } } } },
    "会话号" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Session ID" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "セッション番号" } } } },
    "参与者 A" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Participant A" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者A" } } } },
    "参与者 B" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Participant B" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者B" } } } },
    "视频仅临时解密播放。停止播放、锁屏、切后台或 60 秒无操作即删除临时明文。设备时间与水印不是司法时间戳。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The video is decrypted only temporarily. The temporary plaintext is deleted when playback stops, the device locks, the app backgrounds, or after 60 seconds of inactivity. Device time and watermarks are not legal timestamps." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画は一時的にのみ復号して再生します。再生停止、ロック、バックグラウンド移行、または60秒操作がない場合、一時的な平文を削除します。デバイス時刻と透かしは法的なタイムスタンプではありません。" } } } },
    "加密方式" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encryption method" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化方法" } } } },
    "使用私密空间密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use private space password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースのパスワードを使う" } } } },
    "设置一次性密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Set a one-time password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時パスワードを設定" } } } },
    "确认私密空间密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Confirm private space password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースのパスワードを確認" } } } },
    "一次性密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "One-time password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時パスワード" } } } },
    "输入当前私密空间密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enter current private space password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "現在のプライベートスペースのパスワードを入力" } } } },
    "再次输入一次性密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enter the one-time password again" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時パスワードをもう一度入力" } } } },
    "加密并选择 iCloud Drive 保存位置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypt and choose an iCloud Drive location" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化してiCloud Driveの保存場所を選択" } } } },
    "重新打开保存器" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open the save dialog again" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存画面をもう一度開く" } } } },
    "完成" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Done" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完了" } } } },
    "已加密" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypted" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化済み" } } } },
    "%@" : { "shouldTranslate" : false },
    "%@ · %@" : { "shouldTranslate" : false },
    "------" : { "shouldTranslate" : false },
    "一次性密码不会保存在应用中，请自行妥善保管。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The one-time password is not saved in the app. Keep it somewhere safe." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時パスワードはアプリに保存されません。ご自身で安全に保管してください。" } } } },
    "两台设备应各自完成导出。明文工作文件已删除。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Each device should finish its own export. Plaintext working files have been deleted." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "それぞれのデバイスで書き出しを完了してください。平文の作業ファイルは削除されました。" } } } },
    "先写下你们的名字，再把手机交给每个人亲自确认。整个过程只在这台设备上完成。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enter both names, then hand the phone to each person to confirm. The whole process stays on this device." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの名前を入力し、順番に本人が確認してください。すべてこのデバイス内で行います。" } } } },
    "加密文件已交给系统保存" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The encrypted file was handed to the system to save" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化ファイルをシステムに渡して保存しました" } } } },
    "双方视频已合成为一条成片（A → B）。请设置此设备副本的密码；另一台设备可以使用不同密码。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Both videos were joined into one A → B record. Set a password for this device's copy; the other device may use a different password." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの動画をA → Bの順で1本にまとめました。このデバイスのコピーにパスワードを設定してください。もう1台では別のパスワードを使えます。" } } } },
    "只清除本机配置与草稿，不能删除已导出的 iCloud 文件。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Only settings and drafts on this device are cleared. Exported iCloud files are not deleted." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスの設定と下書きだけを消去します。書き出したiCloudファイルは削除されません。" } } } },
    "将删除本机私密空间、资料与待导出草稿。已导出的加密文件不受影响。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This deletes the private space, profile, and export drafts on this device. Exported encrypted files are unaffected." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのプライベートスペース、プロフィール、書き出し待ちの下書きを削除します。書き出し済みの暗号化ファイルには影響しません。" } } } },
    "将手机交给参与者 %@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hand the phone to participant %@" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者%@にスマートフォンを渡してください" } } } },
    "已用私密空间密码加密暂存最多 10 分钟。重新配对成功后将自动继续传输。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypted with the private space password and staged for up to 10 minutes. Transfer resumes automatically after pairing again." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースのパスワードで暗号化し、最長10分間一時保存します。再ペアリング後、自動的に転送を再開します。" } } } },
    "录制和传输期间请让两台设备保持靠近、保持应用在前台。中断后片段可暂存 10 分钟。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep both devices close and the app active while recording and transferring. A clip can be staged for 10 minutes after an interruption." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "録画と転送中は2台を近くに置き、アプリを前面に保ってください。中断した場合、クリップは10分間一時保存できます。" } } } },
    "录制时将显示明显的 REC 状态和剩余时间；最长 30 秒。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A clear REC indicator and remaining time appear while recording, for up to 30 seconds." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "録画中はREC表示と残り時間が明確に表示されます。最長30秒です。" } } } },
    "我是 %@。我已经成年，也愿意在此刻与 %@ 亲密相处。我知道自己可以在录制前停下来，或者重新确认后再继续。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "I am %@. I am an adult, and I choose to be intimate with %@ at this moment. I know I can pause before recording or continue after checking in again." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "私は%@です。私は成人で、今この瞬間、%@と親密な時間を過ごすことを望んでいます。録画前に立ち止まったり、もう一度確認してから続けたりできると理解しています。" } } } },
    "本机副本已加密" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This device's copy is encrypted" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのコピーを暗号化しました" } } } },
    "本机私密副本已导出" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This device's private copy was exported" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのプライベートコピーを書き出しました" } } } },
    "视频已合成为一条带水印的成片。现在对它加密，明文成片将在加密成功后删除。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The videos were joined into one watermarked record. Encrypt it now; the plaintext video is deleted after encryption succeeds." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画を透かし入りの1本にまとめました。これから暗号化し、成功後に平文の動画を削除します。" } } } },
    "请保持应用在前台，处理中不会上传任何内容。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep the app active. Nothing is uploaded while processing." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "アプリを前面に保ってください。処理中に内容をアップロードすることはありません。" } } } },
    "请在系统文件保存器中选择 iCloud Drive 文件夹。应用不会知道或上传你的 iCloud 内容。若取消保存，加密包将作为待导出草稿保留。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose an iCloud Drive folder in the system save dialog. The app cannot see or upload your iCloud content. If you cancel, the encrypted package stays as an export draft." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "システムの保存画面でiCloud Driveフォルダを選んでください。アプリがiCloudの内容を見たりアップロードしたりすることはありません。キャンセルすると、暗号化パッケージを書き出し待ちの下書きとして残します。" } } } },
    "请在系统文件保存器中选择本机 iCloud Drive 文件夹。取消后将保留待导出草稿。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose this device's iCloud Drive folder in the system save dialog. If canceled, an export draft is kept." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "システムの保存画面でこのデバイスのiCloud Driveフォルダを選んでください。キャンセルすると書き出し待ちの下書きを残します。" } } } },
    "请妥善保管密码。应用已删除本次工作文件中的明文视频；成功导出的加密包默认不在应用内保留副本。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep the password safe. The plaintext working video has been deleted; by default, the app does not retain a copy of a successfully exported encrypted package." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードを安全に保管してください。平文の作業動画は削除されました。正常に書き出した暗号化パッケージのコピーは、通常アプリ内に残しません。" } } } },
    "请把手机交给 %@，由本人读完并亲自开始。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hand the phone to %@ so they can read this and start personally." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@にスマートフォンを渡し、本人が読み終えてから自分で始めてください。" } } } },
    "请由 %@ 本人读完并准备录制。对方也准备好后，两台设备会一起开始 3 秒倒计时。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ should read this personally and get ready. When your partner is ready too, both devices begin a 3-second countdown." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@本人が読み終え、録画の準備をしてください。相手も準備できると、2台で3秒のカウントダウンを始めます。" } } } },
    "请粘贴对方二维码中的文本。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Paste the text from your partner's QR code." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手のQRコード内のテキストを貼り付けてください。" } } } },
    "这些是你在系统“文件”保存器中取消后保留的加密包。成功导出后会删除；也可在此手动删除。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "These encrypted packages were kept after you canceled the system save dialog. They are deleted after a successful export, or you can delete them here." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "システムの保存画面をキャンセルしたため残っている暗号化パッケージです。書き出しに成功すると削除され、ここで手動削除もできます。" } } } },
    "连接已断开。片段仍暂存最多 10 分钟，请重新展示/扫描二维码配对。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The connection ended. The clip stays staged for up to 10 minutes; show or scan the QR code again to pair." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続が切れました。クリップは最長10分間一時保存されます。QRコードをもう一度表示またはスキャンしてペアリングしてください。" } } } },
    "需要相机权限才能录制视频。请在系统设置中允许访问相机。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Camera access is needed to record video. Allow camera access in Settings." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画の録画にはカメラへのアクセスが必要です。設定でカメラを許可してください。" } } } },
    "需要麦克风权限才能录制口述声明。请在系统设置中允许访问麦克风。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Microphone access is needed to record your voice. Allow microphone access in Settings." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "音声の録音にはマイクへのアクセスが必要です。設定でマイクを許可してください。" } } } },
    "当前设备无法使用前置摄像头。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The front camera is unavailable on this device." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスでは前面カメラを使用できません。" } } } },
    "录制正在进行。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recording is already in progress." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "録画中です。" } } } },
    "当前没有进行中的录制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "There is no recording in progress." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "現在録画は行われていません。" } } } },
    "视频录制失败。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Video recording failed." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画の録画に失敗しました。" } } } },
    "无法创建录制写入器。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The video writer could not be created." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画の書き込みを準備できませんでした。" } } } },
    "参与者 %@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Participant %@" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者%@" } } } },
    "请填写两位参与者的姓名。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enter both participants' names." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの参加者の名前を入力してください。" } } } },
    "未找到完成的录制文件。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A completed recording could not be found." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完了した録画ファイルが見つかりません。" } } } },
    "视频文件无法合成。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The video files could not be combined." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画ファイルを結合できません。" } } } },
    "非法会话迁移：%@ → %@。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Invalid session transition: %@ → %@." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "無効なセッション遷移：%@ → %@。" } } } },
    "对方片段哈希校验失败，请重新录制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your partner's clip failed verification. Record it again." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手のクリップを検証できませんでした。もう一度録画してください。" } } } },
    "暂存已超过 10 分钟，请重新录制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The staged clip is more than 10 minutes old. Record it again." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一時保存から10分を超えました。もう一度録画してください。" } } } },
    "对方" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "your partner" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手" } } } },
    "正在校验你的视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Checking your video…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "あなたの動画を確認中…" } } } },
    "正在加密本机副本…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypting this device's copy…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのコピーを暗号化中…" } } } },
    "正在校验并合并双方视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Checking and combining both videos…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりの動画を確認して結合中…" } } } },
    "剩余 %lld 秒" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld seconds remaining" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "残り%lld秒" } } } },
    "最多 30 秒" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Up to 30 seconds" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "最長30秒" } } } },
    "等待对方准备…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Waiting for your partner…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手の準備を待っています…" } } } },
    "本机副本密码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This device's copy password" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスのコピーのパスワード" } } } },
    "至少 12 个字符" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "At least 12 characters" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "12文字以上" } } } },
    "这不是有效的私密记录文件。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This is not a valid private record file." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "有効なプライベート記録ファイルではありません。" } } } },
    "该加密文件版本暂不受支持。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This encrypted file version is not supported." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "この暗号化ファイルのバージョンには対応していません。" } } } },
    "密码不正确。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The password is incorrect." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードが正しくありません。" } } } },
    "文件校验失败，可能已损坏或被修改。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "File verification failed. It may be damaged or modified." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ファイルの検証に失敗しました。破損または変更されている可能性があります。" } } } },
    "找不到要加密的视频。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The video to encrypt could not be found." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化する動画が見つかりません。" } } } },
    "视频缺少可用的视频轨。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The file has no usable video track." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用できる映像トラックがありません。" } } } },
    "视频处理失败。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Video processing failed." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画の処理に失敗しました。" } } } },
    "二维码无效或不属于此版本的应用。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The QR code is invalid or belongs to another app version." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QRコードが無効か、別のバージョンのものです。" } } } },
    "附近设备发送了无效的配对信息。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A nearby device sent invalid pairing information." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "近くのデバイスから無効なペアリング情報を受信しました。" } } } },
    "无法建立安全的双机密钥。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "A secure key between the two devices could not be established." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2台の間で安全な鍵を確立できませんでした。" } } } },
    "无法使用本地网络。请允许本地网络权限并保持两台设备靠近。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The local network is unavailable. Allow local network access and keep both devices close." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ローカルネットワークを使用できません。アクセスを許可し、2台を近くに置いてください。" } } } },
    "尚未开始" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Not started" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "未開始" } } } },
    "正在等待对方扫码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Waiting for your partner to scan" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "相手のスキャンを待っています" } } } },
    "正在寻找附近设备" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Looking for a nearby device" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "近くのデバイスを検索中" } } } },
    "正在建立加密连接" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Creating an encrypted connection" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号化接続を確立中" } } } },
    "请双方确认资料与验证码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Both people should confirm the details and code" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ふたりでプロフィールと確認コードを確認してください" } } } },
    "安全配对已建立" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Secure pairing established" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "安全なペアリングが完了しました" } } } },
    "配对失败" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pairing failed" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ペアリングに失敗しました" } } } },
    "正在校验参与者 %@ 的视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Checking participant %@'s video…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "参加者%@の動画を確認中…" } } } },
    "正在按 A → B 合并两段视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Joining both videos A → B…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "2つの動画をA → Bの順で結合中…" } } } },
    "正在加密视频…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Encrypting video…" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "動画を暗号化中…" } } } },
    "密码至少需要 12 个字符。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The password must be at least 12 characters." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "パスワードは12文字以上必要です。" } } } },
    "提示词最多 60 个字。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The hint can be up to 60 characters." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ヒントは60文字までです。" } } } },
    "本机没有可打开的私密空间。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "There is no private space to open on this device." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このデバイスに開けるプライベートスペースがありません。" } } } },
    "本机私密空间数据损坏或已被修改。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The private space data is damaged or has been modified." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "プライベートスペースのデータが破損または変更されています。" } } } },
    "无法安全派生加密密钥。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The encryption key could not be derived securely." } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暗号鍵を安全に生成できませんでした。" } } } },
    "无法扫码" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to scan" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スキャンできません" } } } },
    "无法开始配对" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to start pairing" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "ペアリングを開始できません" } } } },
    "无法连接" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to connect" } }, "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "接続できません" } } } },
